  Name: E1 Postcard
  Text: "Dear Hronn,                         2/301\r\nI\u2019m writing from the grand
    hot springs, although not currently sitting in them\u2026 that would be impractical!
    They\u2019re very beautiful and relaxing, I really wish you could be here!\r\n\r\nI
    will travel back at the end of the month and will visit you as soon as I arrive!\r\nI
    have many presents, but wont spoil the surprise!\r\nYours,\r\nTerra"
